# Source code, documentation and curated docs/assets/ figures belong in Git.
# Raw data, trained weights and generated experiments remain local.
# Ignore rules do not remove files that Git already tracks; see the publishing guide.

# Local assistant workspace and maintainer-only publishing notes/tools
.codex/
.agents/
.local-work/
/docs/GIT_PUBLISHING.md
/scripts/check_publish.py
/scripts/export_public_snapshot.py
/项目结构与运行指南.md

# Historical experiment notes; public setup instructions live in README.md
/Module/baseline_README.md
/Module/metrics_documentation.md
/Module/网络维持率随机攻击实验_完整技术说明.md

